An idea that I had with only one problem:

Convert AD&D modules G1-3,D1-3,Q1(Against the giants,Descent into the
depths of the Earth, Shrine of the Kua Toa, Queen of the Demonweb Pits) to
Nethack/Moria format. 
It would be based on but not a direct copy of the series.

NB: By 'Moria format' I mean - multi screen, when re-enter a level, it is
       totally regenerated, also the Moria look
    By 'Nethack format' I mean - level generated only once each game, though
       possibly it is multi-screened, also the Nethack look
    MS = multi screened
    ML = multi Leveled
    SS = single screen

* 20000 turns of regular Moria/Angband to build up character and gain
  items, experience.
* God appears, commands you to go on quest
* Teleports you to first giant fortress (Nethack format ML, poss MS)
* Second and third giant fortress(Nethack format ML, poss MS) 
* Into the depths(Moria format ML MS)
* Caverns and Warrens of the troglodytes(Moria ML MS)
* Svirfneblin (SS Moria)
* Shrine of the Kua toa(MS ML Nethack)
* Vault of the Drow(MS ML Nethack)
* the Abyss (SS ML - just Rectangular passages) 
* Various worlds through the doors including The night world, the desert,
  and the siege. (Various formats)
* Lolths Spider ship (Nethack MS ML)


